Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: terminal with command prediction and an on-request agent
 Promptline is a traditional terminal that predicts the command you are
 about to type and, when asked with @agent at the prompt, works on a task
 using what is already in the terminal. Every command the agent wants to
 run needs your approval.
 .
 Inline suggestions from shell history and paths are local and work
 offline. Model-based prediction and @agent use an OpenAI-compatible API
 (including local servers such as Ollama) and are off until configured.
 .
 Promptline is based on Terminator and keeps its grid layouts, tabs,
 broadcast typing, profiles and plugins. It installs alongside Terminator.
